   "text": "claimInheritance  (per heir)\n\nleaf = Commit(bps; H(\"heir\"||sk||vault)) ∈ heirs root\nnullifier H(\"claim\"||sk||vault) not yet used\nq = floor(estate · bps / 10000)\nchecked: q·10000 ≤ estate·bps < (q+1)·10000\nestatePaid + q ≤ estate",
